        "sentence_id": "p2_s11"
      },
      "text": "We will occasionally report on significant activity using a temporary activity clustering name such as TAG-38, where the activity is new and significant but doesn’t map to existing groupings and hasn’t yet graduated or merged into an established activity group.",
